{"zh":"民间随处可见的头巾，摘下来看不过是一块布料而已。","en":"A common headband seen everywhere, nothing more than a strip of cloth when removed."},"defenceVal":"1","hp":"140","price":"500","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1028315","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10017","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ10093","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI103115","name":{"zh":"琅琊诸葛氏","en":"The Zhuge clan of Langya"},"years":["180","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自嬴姓，葛伯之后，迁阳都者称诸葛氏，琅琊郡名门。三国最传奇家族：诸葛亮相蜀、诸葛瑾仕吴、诸葛诞忠魏，“一门三方为冠盖，天下荣之”。","en":"Descended from the Ying surname as scions of the Earl of Ge. Those who relocated to Yangdu adopted the surname Zhuge, becoming an illustrious clan of Langya Commandery. The most legendary Family of the Three Kingdoms: Zhuge Liang served as chancellor of Shu, Zhuge Jin served Wu, and Zhuge Dan remained loyal to Wei—'One clan served as dignitaries across all three realms, honored by all under Heaven.'"},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"2","politics":"9"}},{"id":"GI113515","name":{"zh":"南阳诸葛氏","en":"The Zhuge Clan of Nanyang"},"years":["207","263"],"desc":{"zh":"琅琊诸葛氏家族成员分仕魏、蜀、吴三方。蜀汉“荆益诸葛氏”以诸葛亮为核心，该支在蜀汉位极人臣，影响力最大，但最终在绵竹之战中几乎覆灭。","en":"Members of the Zhuge Family of Langya served across the three realms of Wei, Shu, and Wu. The Jing-Yi Zhuge branch centered around Zhuge Liang, reaching the pinnacle of ministerial rank with immense influence in Shu-Han, though it was ultimately nearly wiped out at the Battle of Mianzhu."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"2","politics":"9"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[49,25,77,68,70,